      "writtenOn": "2026-07-23T18:02:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah true. But a malicious host inducing this condition is basically achieving it by resetting the device I guess. Not sure if there is a way for the host to induce this by keeping the device active. More over the device that needs a DTLB flush in our case is trusted (in SATC).\n\nAnyways, this code is going away as we are not fixing this since its considered a DoS issue.",
